  "details": "1. Set a new custom binding in Steam VR for `personal_mirror`.\n\n2. Open the Action Menu to `Tools`.\n\n3. Watch the Personal Mirror Toggle and see if it updates when the `personal_mirror` binding is activated. You will see it does not correspond to the current Toggle state.\n\nExpected Behavior: A click of the `personal_mirror` binding should also update the Toggle state in the Action Menu.\n\nThis bug may also affect other Personal Mirror Toggles in all other portions of the VRChat HUD, such as the Main Menu.",
